::  modules/flare/husk/glow/fold-husk-recall.glow -- Hybrid score fold!
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-husk-hybrid-score
  |=  [vec-sim=@ud lex-hits=@ud]                        ::  quantized + BM25
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  combined rank
  ~|  'husk-lex-hits-past-cap'                          ::  32-bit bloom max
  ?>  (lte lex-hits 32)                                 ::  bounded 0..32
  (add (mul vec-sim 4) (mul lex-hits 16))               ::  4*vec + 16*lex
--
